    "description": "1:1 math tutor with super math solver app Magic Math\r\n\r\nOwning a math app for math problem solver from simple to complex is easier than ever in just 3 seconds: open the math solver app, scan the picture math and check the math answers.\r\nWith Magic Math, users can solve math problems like addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division, as well as more complex extra math problems like calculating the area, perimeter, and volume of various geometries. In addition, the math helper app also allows users to solve algebraic problems such as complex and difficult equations and systems. This math homework helper application helps save time, costs and motivates in learning when you are bored with traditional math problems calculation methods.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd0  Magic Math Solver with 7\ufe0f\u20e3 main features:\r\n\r\n\u267b Solve math problems quickly: With only 3 seconds\r\n\u267b Diverse math problems: math calculator from basic to complex with 12+ types of math homework\r\n\u267b Friendly interface, easy to use\r\n\u267b Detailed math answers: step by step math explanation\r\n\u267b Serving a variety of users: students, parents, teachers, etc.\r\n\u267b Supports 12 keyboards for all math types\r\n\u267b Used for a variety of subjects that need to be calculated: Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, etc.\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2795 <b>Diversity of users </b>\r\nOur smart quick math help provide a convenient math solution equation for all users, including students, teachers, parents or anyone who needs to calculate. In addition to difficult photo math like geometry solver & delta math , math apps also act as an effective hand-held smart math calculator, serving daily math helper calculation needs. This is guaranteed to be an effective math problem solver assistant for users with difficult and complex math questions.\r\n\r\n\u2796 <b> Solve wide range of math problems </b>\r\nNot only does it support math homework, this math helper also helps users with delta math, gauth math, difficult math answer equations and formulas of physics and chemistry. This picture math application supports to  solve math problems with 12 types of math answers from beginner to advanced:\r\nPre-Algebra, Algebra, Precalculus, Trigonometry, Calculus, Statistics, Triangle, Chemistry, Physics, Finite Math, Linear Algebra, Graphing,etc\r\n\r\n\r\n\u23f0 <b>Math scanner to enter the math word problems </b>\r\nThe outstanding feature of this smart calculator is the ability to scan math to enter problems. Users can enter math word problems manually or scan math problems images from books, tables or anywhere. After entering the math questions, the math problem solver application will display suggestions on how to solve quick math. If you are still not able to solve math problems according to the suggestions, it will provide detailed math solutions.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08 In addition, if the user enters the snap math manually, this math picture solver supports 12 common keyboard types to easily enter complex characters and math symbols\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf88 End a series of days of stalemate in difficult extra math problems with the magic math super math solver application. Now, in addition to being used for simple daily calculations, users can use it as an effective picture math tool for learning and teaching. Especially for parents, this can be considered a secret for hard-working math tutor hours.\r\n\r\nDon't miss out !!!  When it only takes 3 seconds to download and experience the amazing math feature.  Let\u2019s share camera math homework helper with your friends! \u2665",
